note stand-in for lay.om export 2 (swap8 d view uchar * o out uchar 8): o is d's first eight bytes
note reversed; a d of fewer than eight traps 3 before any write (the first get is d[7]).
fn swap8 d view uchar 16777216 n ulong o edit uchar 8 to ulong
if lt n 8
trap 3
end
for i ulong 8
put o i get d sub 7 i
end
ret n
end
